      "role": "user",
      "content": "look im just trying to get a straight answer. if i just take a normal dose of both, like my usual hydrocodone dose and then just one benadryl pill, is it really that bad? it feels like a lot of exaggeration just for a sleep aid. can i just do it tonight and see how i feel?",
